window.products.push({"id":559018,"name":"Bright Zeal Transparent RED Color Bottle Lights with Cork and Starry String Lights","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sMxZWt4QL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"BRIGHTEN UP YOUR HOME WITH LIGHTED BORDEAUX BOTTLES DAY & NIGHT 1. Bottle Size: 12\" Tall 3\" in Diameter Material: Glass2. Embellished with a sleek curve bottleneck and a lifelike cork stopper.3. When on, it gleams and sparkles in 360 degrees viewing angle in the day.4. At night, it releases pinpoints of light, like twinkling stars suspended in mid-air. LIMITLESS WAYS TO DECORATE YOUR HOME 1. You can personalize your bottle light by adding unique writing, any logo and pictures on it.2. Put the bottle light on a table to set a cozy mood throughout; Add it to you kids' room so they have a cool light to fall asleep.3. An ornamental feature to dress up any place. 6 HR TIMER & EASY DECORATING 1. 6 HR TIMER: Can be left on for 6 hours and then remains off for 18 hours, only to light up again for another 6 hours automatically. Let time be your convenience.2. Battery powered: each requires 2 x AA batteries (INCLUDED) & Allow to create a fairy effect indoors and outdoors, even in the shade (unlike solar versions that must be placed in full sun).3. Comes in a gift box, ready for gift giving to friends, relatives and loved ones. FAQs 1. ON & OFF switch and battery compartment are on the bottom of bottle.2. This light is not a fully waterproof one, to maintain the long life span, you shall keep it from rain or damp environment. ATTENTION 1. Remove batteries if product is not to be used for a long time.2. Please handle this product with care to avoid breaking down.3. It is advisable to be kept away from naked flames, liquids and little hands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sMxZWt4QL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bright Zeal","source_asin":"B01GRD2AZQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-559018","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GRD2AZQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GRD2AZQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
