window.products.push({"id":559240,"name":"Gift Mark Childs Rocking Chairs - Classic Hand-Made Wooden Rockers for Boys and Girls - Vintage Style Colonial Kid's Seats - Childrens Furniture Rocke","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CCby+ss+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description Gift Mark: Childrens Wooden Colonial Rocking Chair (Black) Nothing makes kids happier than when they get to have something that all the adults and big kids are using, especially when it's made just for them! Our Children's Double Slat Rocking Chair is durable enough to last a lifetime, and made safe with rounded edges in the perfect size and weight for kids! They'll love the soothing natural rocking motion. We recommend this chair for toddlers to kids about 8 years old or pre-k/kindergarten to the 4th grade (it depends a little on how big your kids are). Get real furniture for your kids that's made to last! Simply Quality We include everything you need to make assembly fast and easy. Each box includes all of the parts and tools you need to put your chair together in minutes. Each chair uses real wood and is perfect for everything from reading to study time, lounge and TV time in the living room, enjoying indoors or outdoors on the porch, and much more! Give the Perfect Presents Childs Chairs make the perfect gifts for any occasion! It's a simple thing they'll use every day for years to come. They make great gifts for starting school, birthdays, Christmas, holidays, Easter, and more. A rocker sized just for them is the perfect addition to any little boys or girls room. Check out our full selection of colors and chairs to find the best chairs for you! The Mark of Quality We like for the gifts we buy to be high quality. We like them to be wonderful things that are made to last, so every time the gift is used the recipient thinks of you. That's why we're called Gift Mark, we make pieces that are designed better, we hold ourselves to a higher standard of quality, design, and construction. Whether it's a gift, or it's for you make sure it has Gift Mark quality. From the Manufacturer Our Gift Mark White Solid Hardwood Colonial Rocking Chair is Designed for Beauty and Durability. This Rocker is built to Last, and will be part of your Family for years to come. Easy to Assemble.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CCby+ss+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gift Mark","source_asin":"B002G1ZQ0A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-559240","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002G1ZQ0A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002G1ZQ0A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
