window.products.push({"id":559304,"name":"Gifts for Men Dad Husband Whiskey Glasses Set Chilling Stones Gifts for Birthday Boyfriend Dad Festival Anniversary Retirement","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41f6F6H5-mL._AC_.jpg","description":"Are you tired of melting the ice cubes that dilute the drink? Tired of looking for ice cubes for guests who just came in, but found that there is no ice cube reservation? Why add stones instead of ice cubes to the whiskey? Because it can bring better taste to whiskey? Yes, there’s a bit of novelty in the fact that you’re including actual rocks instead of ice to your drink, but that’s a major part of the appeal. It will add the perfect chill without diluting it down.  Whiskey “on the rocks” never looked or tasted this good! Isn’t it more interesting to experience a different taste from ice cubes? If you like your whiskey cold, an ice cube used to be a necessary evil. Fortunately, these chilling offer a way to keep your drink cool without watering it down. Use: Rinse before first usage then places in your freezer until the stones reach desired coldness. When ready, add two or three stones to your glass. Fill the glass with enough liquid to cover the stones. Let the drink sit for a few minutes, allowing the stones to properly chill your drink. After use, simply rinse and allow the stones to dry before placing them back in the freezer. Never chew or attempt to eat. Designed for whiskey, but also perfect for all other beverages. Whiskey stones: Classic, affordable, and has a nice look, perfect for birthdays, Holidays such as housewarming, retirement, and Christmas are given as gifts. And whisky was originally used to aid digestion, which is why Whisky is called \"the water of life\".Use the whiskey stone to cool the liquor and drink only the true taste of the whiskey, which represents some Loyal fans pay homage to this remarkable distilled spirit. Note: The whisky stone cools the drink only slightly. It means that it helps the whisky release its aroma and makes it smoother. Whisk Stones doesn't cool as much as","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41f6F6H5-mL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOCAL","source_asin":"B09MLDGR3M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-559304","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MLDGR3M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MLDGR3M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
