window.products.push({"id":559461,"name":"Kivik Fluffy Comforter Cover Set King Size, Shaggy Faux Fur Plush Duvet Cover,Crystal Velvet Bedding Set Zipper Closure Fuzzy Cover 3 Pieces (1 Duvet ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717PKdbFSEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cloud-soft Fuzziness: Kivik duvet cover bed set features fluffy shaggy faux fur top and plush fuzzy crystal velvet fleece bottom, both won’t fade, pill, or wrinkle. With feathery texture that’s lambwool warm, these covers create cloud-soft sensations with a touch of chic romance and luxury. Universal Sizes: Available in king size (1 x duvet cover 104\"x 90\", 2 x pillowcases 20\"x 36\"). Choose a set most fitting to your bed and comforter. Or match them with Kivik Sherpa Fleece Weighted Blanket / Minky Dot Sherpa Weighted Blanket to obtain the utmost softness and comfort. Wide Uses: It’s a comforter cover, also a stand-alone blanket in warm days. Insert a comforter or duvet in cold winter to keep the inside clean and elevate its keep-warm performance with added softness. These faux fur duvet covers offer the tenderest furry touch to your bedroom and dorm, making the chicest photo prop, and the most popular gift to family and friends. Thoughtful Details: Secure the duvet onto the cover through 8 sturdy ties to form a solid pack so the inside won’t shift around. Hidden zipper allows for easy insertion and separation without compromising its uniformed look and feel. Tight stitches and active dying technology keep the cover and pillowcases good as new after washes. Envelop pillowcases are ready and easy to use with a complete finish. Care Tips: Take the duvet out before washing. Wash the cover set inside out with cold water and tumble dry on low heat, do not bleach / iron / hang to dry to avoid deformation. Wash before first use to get rid of cutting debris and be nicer to the skin. Shake and fluff up the long fur after each wash to restore to its original beautiful state. If there are any questions, please feel free to contact our customer care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717PKdbFSEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kivik","source_asin":"B0933FZ257","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-559461","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0933FZ257","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0933FZ257","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":559462,"name":"Measured Liquor Bottle Pourer, 2 oz, Clear Spout Bottle Pourer with White Tail and Black Collar, Measured Pour Spouts by Tezzorio","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31GUeEtv4wL._AC_.jpg","description":"HOW TO POUR A MEASURED VOLUME OF LIQUID: Step 1 - Before using the pourer, soak it in warm, soapy water for 10-12 minutes, then rinse in cold water. Step 2 – In order to install, wet the cork in warm water and push the pourer straight into the bottle, making sure the collar fits snuggly over the opening. Step 3 - Hold the bottle at a 45-degree angle when pouring. Ensure a naturally pouring motion is used; do not try to \"whip\" or \"baby\" the bottle into pouring position. Step 4 - When the bottle is low, allow liquor to reach the neck of the bottle before tilting the 45-degree angle. Place the spout to the lip of the glass, then raise the tail of the bottle. Step 5 - To wash, soak the pourer in warm, soapy water, then rinse in cold water. Step 6 - If cork fins flatten, run it under hot water for approximately 30 seconds, then run under cold water. This will straighten the fins. To remove, twist and pull straight up out of the bottle. For best performance with spirits, we recommend to wash it weekly, when used with cordials, syrups, or juices, wash nightly. NOTE: Do not run through the dishwasher or wash in extremely hot water. Pourers will not be effective with water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31GUeEtv4wL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tezzorio","source_asin":"B07CHX3YP3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-559462","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CHX3YP3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CHX3YP3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
