window.products.push({"id":559490,"name":"Chantal \"Lotus\" ceramic pour over coffee dripper, 8 ounces, Aqua","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oh7tf0HhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Part of the Craft Coffee Collection, Chantal’s Lotus Ceramic Filter is perfect for brewing hand crafted coffee with its innovative shape resembling the lotus flower The filter provides a uniquely designed handle, view through filter window ensuring coffee does not over flow and two small holes for slow dripping and maximum flavor. Optimally accommodates #2 paper filters. Non-porous glaze will not react with foods or flavors and all Chantal ceramics are lead and cadmium free and meet FDA and CA Prop 65 requirements. Instructions included to brew your own pour-over coffee. Founded in October 1971, Chantal Corporation is proud to be approaching 50 years of strength, determination and success. CEO and founder, German-born Heida Thurlow, relocated to the United States in 1970 and soon began the first woman in the U.S to launch and run a cookware company. She has received numerous design and utility patents for teakettle and cookware design and innovation. Chantal was the first to bring dramatic color, tempered glass lids and stay-cool handles to the kitchenware marketplace and continues to dedicate itself to the creation of innovative products that bring elegance to the home. Chantal’s focus has always been on creating and providing the best products for healthy Cooking Our products feature the healthiest nontoxic materials and cooking surfaces available today. We pledge to continually look for new innovations and manufacturing techniques which will be ideal for health conscious chefs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oh7tf0HhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chantal","source_asin":"B086X731MS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-559490","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086X731MS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086X731MS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
