window.products.push({"id":559565,"name":"Pyramid America Super Mario Power Up Nintendo Video Game Gaming Fantasy Trippy Flocked UV Black Light Blacklight Poster 23x35 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JrBMYxuML._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Poster measures 23x35 inches (59x89 cm) and ideal size for any standard 23x35 frame. Lightweight and low-glare satin finish paper creates photo quality poster art for your home decor. All poster prints are carefully rolled and packed. UV REACTIVE INK GLOWS - Blacklight Posters are great alternatives for tapestries. Instead of fabric tapestry, elevate your home decor through optic black light as a scary and spooky Halloween horror decoration or retro groovy party art. These UV light posters are blacklight reactive for a trippy glow in the dark effect. TRIPPY DECOR FOR ANY ROOM - Do you want to give your home a fresh lease on life, are a terrific way to give any room in your house a unique, energetic, and creative feel. Use blacklight reactive-UV lighting to make it glow, and the vibrant psychedelic pattern on our black light posters will come to life. Its the perfect finishing touch for your stylish room design, including your bedroom, kitchen, bathroom, and childrens room. length Blacklights are a great alternative to tapestries for wall decor. Instead of a fabric tapestry, consider an optic black light as a scary Halloween decoration or retro groovy party art for your bedroom or dorm. Create a cool trippy, psychedelic effect in any room when you use an ultraviolet UV light in any dark room. Glowing black light art ranges from large modern pictures to vintage, groovy stoner smoking art. These groovy UV posters are blacklight reactive for a trippy glow in the dark effect. Flocked fluorescent posters have a velvet feel. Cool black light posters imitate a psychedelic hallucination on your wall. Velvet blacklight posters are a luminous gift for Christmas or a birthday, or any other holiday. Use them in a bedroom, living room, or office. Just dont forget the UV light to make the most out of these trippy blacklight posters.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JrBMYxuML._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pyramid America","source_asin":"B07GWX1GSH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-559565","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GWX1GSH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GWX1GSH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":559566,"name":"The Kosher Cook Dairy Blue Kitchen Linen Apron, Oven Mitt, Pot Holder, and Mini Oven Mitt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AYwp1OlYL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep your kitchen kosher while using the highest quality cookware with all items from The Kosher Cook! Our aprons are the perfect combination of comfortable and durable so you can freely cook and clean without worrying about messing up your clothes. Each baking apron is color-coded so you know at a glance if it is used for preparing meat, dairy or parve dishes. PRODUCT FEATURES Cotton Full-Length for Universal Fit Adjustable StrapDetachable Towel includedMachine Washable Color Coded Kitchen Tools for Kosher Household: - Blue for Dairy (Milchig)- Red for Meat (Fleishig)- Green For Parve Make your time in the kitchen a lot easier and stress-free by using our aprons that are made to provide you with absolute quality. Our aprons are made out of 100% cotton so they’re high quality and strong to not wear or tear easily. It is also incredibly comfortable to wear over any kind of attire. Two adjustable straps around your neck and waist make applying it fast and easy. The detachable kitchen towel is just the right thing to help you keep even cleaner. Just place it all in the washing machine when it's time to wash and let it come out fresh and new. KEEPING A KOSHER KITCHEN The Kosher Cook provides a wide array of kitchen tools to help separate milchig, fleishig and parev. Color coded products and tools along with labels and stickers allow you to see at a glance if the item is dairy, meat or pareve. Whether you are new to keeping kashrut or a seasoned veteran looking to make life easier, the Kosher Cook has the tools to help you keep the highest standards of kosher cooking. About The Kosher Cook Part of the Ner Mitzvah family, The Kosher Cook is another way we to help you keep Jewish traditions and laws. Family-operated since the 1940’s, Ner Mitzvah is an expert maker of household products and the premier source for all jewish traditional and Judaica items and gifts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AYwp1OlYL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Kosher Cook","source_asin":"B08XDPHMW6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-559566","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XDPHMW6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XDPHMW6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
