window.products.push({"id":559626,"name":"Warmfill Over Sink Dish Drying Rack, Stainless Steel 2 Tier Over Sink Dish Rack with Utensils Holder, Cutting Board Holder, Non-Rust Stable Over Sink ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X-YrzFHWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Save Much Counter Space: This dish drying rack over the sink helps free up so much room on kitchen counter and the dishes just drain over the sink and dry so fast. It is so nice to have the dishes off the countertop so it doesn’t look cluttered all the time; Must have for kitchens 2 Tier Large Capacity & Multi-functional: This above sink dish rack is spacious enough to hold up to 20 dishes, 32 bowls, several pots, pans, fruits, plants and other kitchen stuffs. Also comes with a utensils holder, a cutlery holder, a cutting board holder, a sponge holder and several metal hooks for different organization needs Non-rust& Last for Long: This over kitchen sink shelf is made of premium 201 Stainless Steel, you will never worry about rusting issue. This over sink drying rack will more durable than other iron dish racks, and last for years in use Enhanced Stability: This over sink dish drainer with “h” shape bottom brackets can better bear the heavy weight and more stable than others with upright feet design. With non-slip rubber feet, the kitchen over sink rack can stay in place and prevents scratches on countertop. Easy to assemble by yourself in minutes Fits Most Kitchen Sink: Inside dimension: 32.2 (L) x 9.6 (W) x 32.1 (H) inches; Outside dimension: 34 (L) x 11.4 (W) x 32.1(H) inches. This over sink organizer rack fits sinks with length < 32 inch","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X-YrzFHWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Warmfill","source_asin":"B0892QDJDT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-559626","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0892QDJDT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0892QDJDT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
