window.products.push({"id":559648,"name":"Hagary Cherry Blossom Rainbow Chopsticks Metal Chopsticks Reusable Designed In Korea Japanese Style Stainless Steel 316 18/10 Non-Slip Dishwasher Safe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EDZB-qosL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SAKURA INSPIRED ART: If you are one who enjoys Asian cuisine, Korean noodles, Japanese sushi, Chinese dumplings, or Thai Food, these Hagary Reusable Stainless Steel Chopsticks are for you! These classic Japanese-style stainless steel chopsticks are suitable for households that use them often. Designed in Korea, add an element of Zen to your dining table with the Cherry Blossom Pattern and have a great dining experience with your loved ones. Great for those who have contemporary tastes. DURABLE AND HEALTHY: Made of 316 (18/10) stainless steel, which is above food-grade steel and complies with the most strict food-contact standards. The 316 stainless steel is sturdier than 304, more durable, more resistant to corrosion and higher temperature, and has a less metallic taste so you will enjoy the natural taste of your food without worry. Unlike bamboo or wood chopsticks, this will not get mold and will not hide dirt so you will be sure of using sparkling clean kitchen utensils. NON SLIP DESIGN: Hagary chopsticks are non-slip due to their textured tips, allowing you to easily grip dumplings, noodles, sushi rolls, tempura, ramen, rice, fries, or chicken popcorn. They are also square, so they do not slide off the table, making them an excellent choice for a more enjoyable dining experience. They have a perfect weight so your hands will not get tired, weighing only 0.073 pounds. It's ideal for grilling Korean BBQ meat or pulling food from a Chinese hot pot. ORIGINALLY DESIGNED IN KOREA: The laser-etched Cherry Blossom or Sakura pattern is originally designed in Korea which is a great addition to any dinner table setting. Feel like royalty by using these classy eating utensils for you and your family to enjoy delicious Asian dishes, meals, and good company. From the sleek design to its elegant packaging, these chop sticks are carefully made to give you the best dining experience you can have like in expensive Asian restaurants. WILL NOT GET RUST: They will not produce any harmful substances, so the stainless steel castings plated are very safety use. These chopsticks will not get rust and last long. You will be sure you are using only the best eating utensils for your daily family dinner, casual, or formal events. To avoid scratching the outer layer, refrain from using iron scrubber on our chopsticks. DISHWASHER SAFE AND REUSABLE: These fantastic chopsticks can go straight in the dishwasher, all day every day, meaning it can save you time, and be more hygienic. A pair of metal chopsticks can be reused a lot of times, unlike the wooden disposable ones which only last for months and are thrown away. It saves time and money to replace the chopsticks on a regular basis. Hagary chopsticks are also reusable compared to the tons of disposable chopsticks that end up in landfills every day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EDZB-qosL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hagary","source_asin":"B0BT9ZKMD5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-559648","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BT9ZKMD5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BT9ZKMD5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
